# Virtual environments
.venv

# Secrets -- never commit real credentials.
# See docs/audits/PROJECT_AUDIT.md (finding C2) / docs/planning/TECHNICAL_DEBT.md
# (TD-2): this repo previously had no rule excluding `.env`, which is one
# commit away from leaking real Azure/LangSmith credentials. Use
# `.env.example` as the template for a local `.env`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

